=============== ftp://ftp.eff.org/pub/CAF/faq/umanitoba.ca ===============
q: What is going on at the University of Manitoba in Canada? What is
the Canadian law on obscenity?

a: Here is some information related to the alt.sex* ban at the U. of Manitoba.

